        },
        {
          "text": " Nakerio emalaika akekan adodit Yerusalem amudiar ŋes, kiitu EJAKAIT aronis, kotema emalaika loamudiari ituŋa atiar, “Adol do; kinyaka akonikan.” Edunyas emalaika loka EJAKAIT kepejal loka Arauna Eyebusit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.16",
